查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-request-checklist-v1","title":"发起伤害计算前要补齐什么","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 条件 攻击方 防守方 对手 清单 输入 问诊","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。\n\n建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":6856,"checksum":"sha256:bd79ff5a9c99bc64643b994b76d26c5d211729600ac90fa3b3132cf3628d94d4","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-31321f7580ac3c751942d9cf3430417430241bbd38e921e8795eb64442cc4d83","documentVersion":"sha256:604a2524e320f0d16e72cd129d9e2c64fcdbdc0b08e93a96f3440959b762f026","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":133,"text":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。","contentHash":"sha256:6ab5af4c458922fc236120308379f43e89d51ca5851d00dcae346356a70c9534"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-assumptions-v1","title":"如何解读伤害区间","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 秒杀 击倒 倍率 damage calc 天气 场地","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":6478,"checksum":"sha256:065a2df65c589c40b9e6c4dd391f2526bbef8660744f804f2d4a5704b892d328","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ec5990770c15e5e1c9072cd94ff2093ce77edeca241d3f84e929aef60ee4dfeb","documentVersion":"sha256:f3323fc95ec350b77f0486650aff1db19b899a58fbdc4634445d6def6c3e7fd3","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":201,"text":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","contentHash":"sha256:4147350b9f74e866fdff162eb8da3276833061e4cc05e6f7531e1027e4f58c34"}},{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["project"]}},"score":3617,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ef248d8303fab055bd6c49179810ca0be35fac5a5615b3460092d055533ff522","documentVersion":"sha256:83175ceac095f48bee8896bb5e6cbde7d8ad417c22c1b6a38eb14f023450c6ea","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":287,"text":"预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","contentHash":"sha256:d820cfe8f51da68ee49319ad8cec7abd979e363831631dc7d7135fa35ba1ec4e"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@56362d87}
